    "displayName": "SAEBench Core",
    "aliases": ["SAEBench core metrics"],
    "description": "Replaces the activations of the model with the SAE output and measures the loss that the model keeps (loss recovered), the KL divergence and the explained variance. It also counts the active latents for each token (L0) and the latents that never activate.",
